  <spoon:CtClass name="LreController">
    <comment xsi:type="spoon:CtJavaDoc" commentContent="The Last Response Engine: the AUV's safety controller (LRE-ARCH1,&#xA;LRE-ARCH2). It sits between the operator controller and the autopilot,&#xA;reads the sensor each step, and advises velocity and heading through the&#xA;actuator."/>
